    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d286">

                <pb facs="0337" n="329" sameAs="frus:frus1941v03/pg329"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">383.0063/34</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Egyptian Minister for Foreign Affairs</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Samy</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the American Minister in Egypt</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Kirk</hi>)<anchor n="76"
                        xml:id="d286-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Translation]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. P. 2—38.106/2 <lb/> No. P 12167</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Cairo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1941-07-24">July 24, 1941</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Minister</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge
                    the receipt of Your Excellency’s letter No. 74 of July 12, 1941 in regard to the
                    proposed <pb facs="0338" n="330" xml:id="pg330"/> legislation for the
                    elaboration and modification of Law No. 40 of 1934 concerning the activities of
                    private educational institutions.</p>
                <p>I have not failed to transmit the contents of this letter to the competent
                    authorities and to request them to make a detailed examination of the question
                    in the light of the assurances given by this Ministry.<anchor n="78"
                        xml:id="d286-f2"/></p>
                <p>I avail myself [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Salib Samy</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d286-f1" n="76" type="source" xml:id="d286-f1-content">
                <p>Copy transmitted to the Department by the Minister in Egypt in his despatch No.
                    82, August 8; received December 9.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d286-f2" n="78" xml:id="d286-f2-content">
                <p>There is no indication in the Department files that any further negotiations took
                    place on this issue.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
